flowchart TB

%% CLIENTS
Client[Web App / Mobile App]

%% ENTRY
Client --> CDN
CDN --> ReverseProxy

ReverseProxy[Nginx / Caddy]

ReverseProxy --> API

%% API LAYER
API[Golang API Server]

%% CORE SERVICES
API --> AuthService
API --> UserService
API --> ProductService
API --> VersionService
API --> PostService
API --> FeedService
API --> CommentService
API --> LikeService
API --> FollowService
API --> CollectionService
API --> OrderService
API --> PaymentService
API --> CommissionService
API --> MessageService
API --> TipService
API --> PromotionService
API --> DownloadService

%% DATABASE
API --> PostgreSQL[(PostgreSQL)]

%% CACHE
API --> Redis[(Redis Cache)]

%% FILE STORAGE
API --> MinIO[(MinIO Object Storage)]

%% SEARCH
API --> Meilisearch[(Meilisearch)]

%% PAYMENT PROVIDER
PaymentService --> Stripe[Stripe / Payment Provider]

%% OPTIONAL WORKERS
API --> JobQueue[Background Workers]

JobQueue --> PostgreSQL
JobQueue --> Redis
JobQueue --> MinIO
JobQueue --> Meilisearch